Detection empty pipe on.\n\nMV145:\n- HV + lit. battery rec.: \"100 – 240 V AC\"; 45–66 Hz; backup \"3.7 V DC; 5200 mAh;\"\n- LLV + alk. battery: \"10 – 48 V DC\"; freq blank; backup \"9V DC\"\n- LLV + lit. battery Li-SOCl2: \"10 – 48 V DC\"; freq \"-\"; backup \"3.6V DC;\"\nSoftware: V.1.05.0004.0005 for MV145; CRC C96453B1 for MV145; cut-off 0.2%; detection on.\n\nNote from description: MV145 HV backup \"3,7V DC lithium battery\"; MV145 LLV+alk \"9V DC alka. battery\"; MV145 LLV+lit \"3.6V DC lithium Battery Li-SOCl2\".\n\nConfig-level power entries: I'll use axis \"module_designation\" with the six module names.\n\npower_supply_voltage:\n- \"MS2500 / MV110 HV\": {100,240} V\n- \"MS2500 / MV110 LV\": {24,36} V\n- \"MS2500 / MV110 LLV\": {10,48} V\n- \"MS2500 / MV145 HV + lit. battery\": {100,240} V\n- \"MS2500 / MV145 LLV + alk. battery\": {10,48} V\n- \"MS2500 / MV145 LLV + lit. battery\": {10,48} V\n\npower_supply_type:\n- HV: \"AC\" (mains AC); LV: \"AC/DC\"; LLV: \"DC\"; MV145 HV: \"AC\"; MV145 LLV alk: \"DC\"; MV145 LLV lit: \"DC\"\n\npower_supply_frequency:\n- HV (MV110): {45,66} Hz; LV: {45,66} Hz; MV145 HV: {45,66} Hz. Omit DC ones.\n\ninternal_backup_source (string):\n- MV110 HV: \"3.7 V DC lithium battery, 5200 mAh\"\n- MV110 LV: \"3.7 V DC lithium battery, 5200 mAh\"\n- MV145 HV: \"3.7 V DC lithium battery, 5200 mAh\"\n- MV145 LLV + alk: \"9 V DC alkaline battery\"\n- MV145 LLV + lit: \"3.6 V DC lithium battery (Li-SOCl2)\"\n\nOK. Also nominal frequency note \"50/60\" not given; fine.\n\nNow, \"Frequency\" header just says \"Frequency:\" — for AC mains supplies. Values 45–66 Hz.\n\nNow build JSON. Keep units: m³/h → unit_symbol \"m³/h\". m³ → \"m³\". mm → \"mm\". MPa → \"MPa\". °C → \"°C\".\n\nunit_id: leave null everywhere (rule 3: leave null unless certain; I could fill some like u:degree_Celsius but I'll mostly leave null; maybe fill a couple obvious ones? Instruction says leave null unless certain. I'll leave all null to be safe).\n\nStructure of mo